<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes higher led by KB and SPT Telecom.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes higher led by KB and SPT Telecom.</headline>
<text>
<p>1300 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes higher in relatively heavy trading on Wednesday.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX up 8.3 points, 0.7 percent, to 1,174.8</p>
<p>* Turnover 39.98 million crowns</p>
<p>* Komercni rises 50 crowns to 2,450</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom rises 10 crowns to 3,400. SPT most heavily traded share woth turnover of 11.5 million crowns</p>
<p>* CEZ falls one crown to 1,074</p>
<p>* RIF falls six crowns to 1,004</p>
<p>* Chemopetrol up 35 crowns to 1,280</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 42-2423-0003</p>
</text>
